  clientName: Clark
  jobDescription: Connect Ironhaven's freight yard to the warehouse district with
    a 110-meter, two-way bridge. All four cargo trucks must cross safely, with two
    travelling in each direction. Consider how the roadway, hangers, cables, towers,
    and anchorages work together.
